# Words and phrases that sort what a player says into an intent. Format: see IntentPhrases.cs.
# Commas split phrases. A phrase counts when its words appear in a row; the longest one wins.
# Rude and real-world words are checked before this file, so "thanks, idiot" stays rude.
# Chat shorthand is read as its words first (grp = group, wanna = want to, cya = see you, ...;
# the list is Shorthand in AutonomousChatIntentModel.cs), so write phrases in full words.
# Intents: greeting, banter, abuse, grouping, grinding, travel, dungeon, rvr, trading, help,
# farewell, ignoreoutofworld, thank, and the small talk ones: joke, grumble, smalltalk,
# question, compliment, agree, quote, jokeask, laugh, sorry, disagree, away, back, activity,
# howgoing, mood, flirt, outofworldchat. Then command and combatcall, which beat game words.
# Bots answer in their "~ reply <intent>" section; a bot without one for a small-talk intent
# answers from "~ reply banter". The short reactions (laugh, sorry, disagree, away, back) get
# one brief line from one bot now and then, and no answer otherwise. The other newest intents
# are answered as their nearest older one for now (Collapse in AutonomousChatIntentModel.cs).
# A game word (group, dungeon, buy, frontier...) beats small talk, greetings and farewells:
# "yeah, want to group" is grouping. A grouping phrase with a dungeon or realm word in the line
# is that dungeon or frontier trip ("who's up for a keep?").
=== intents

~ intent greeting
hello, hi, hey, heya, hiya, howdy, hail, greetings, yo, what's up, well met, good morning
good evening, good afternoon, evening all, morning all, evening everyone, morning everyone

~ intent farewell
bye, goodbye, bye bye, see you, see you later, later guys, later all, laters, good night, night all
logging off, logging out, log off, off to bed, heading to bed, got to go, i'm out, take care
safe travels, farewell, until next time, see you tomorrow

~ intent thank
thanks, thank, thankyou, thx, thnx, ty, tyvm, cheers, ta
appreciate it, much appreciated, many thanks, you're the best, you are the best, lifesaver
saved me, you saved, owe you, owe you one, saved my life

~ intent abuse
go die, stfu, shut up, kill yourself, nobody likes you, get lost, piss off

~ intent banter
you're so, you are so, you look like, you smell, your mom, hit like, is that all, you call that
slowpoke, noob, nub, scrub, shorty, you're fat, fatty, loser buys, race you, ugly, taller than you
shorter than you, bet you can't, nice try, too slow, are you a

~ intent grouping
who wants to, anyone want to, anybody want to, anyone up for, who's up for, up for some
looking for group, looking for more, looking for power, power level, can join, can i join, room for, join you, join your, invite me, invite please
team up, need healer, need a healer, need a tank

~ intent grinding
where to level, place to level, spot to level, good spot, good place to level, what should hunt
camping the, farming, farm these, xp, leveling, level up, how much xp

~ intent dungeon
dungeon, dungeon run, entrance to, spraggon den, cursed tomb, darkness falls, keltoi fogou, nisse's lair
big pull inside

~ intent rvr
keep under attack, take a keep, take keep, relic raid, realm points, the frontier, to the frontier
emain, albion, midgard, hibernia, at the bridge

~ intent travel
how do get to, how do i get to, which way to, way to, stable master, how far, where am i, take me to
where do i find, where's the, where is the, horse to, lost again

~ intent trading
want to sell, want to buy, want to trade, how much for, selling, for sale, worth, price check
craft me, realm exchange

~ intent help
how do i, how does, what does, i'm stuck, stuck, can someone help, can anyone help, help me
what class should, how do spec, explain

~ intent joke
why did the, why do, why don't, what do you call, what did the, walks into, walked into a
knock knock, want to hear a joke, did you hear, heard the one, joke, kidding, just kidding, i'm kidding, jk

~ intent jokeask
tell me a joke, tell us a joke, tell a joke, know a joke, know a good joke, know any jokes
got a joke, got any jokes, something funny, make me laugh

~ intent laugh
lol, lmao, rofl, haha, hahaha, hehe, heh, that's funny, that is funny, so funny, good one

~ intent grumble
ugh, argh, sigh, meh, sucks, this sucks, so slow, so boring, annoying, so annoying
waste of time, taking forever, takes forever, hate this, hate when, so tired of
keep dying, died again, nothing drops, no drops, what a pain, not again, killing me, lag, laggy
hit too hard, hits too hard, way too hard, another death, everything aggro, my back hurts

~ intent smalltalk
once saw, once had, once met, back home, when i was, story time, fun fact, long day, long night
weather, raining, sunny, snowing, cold out, hungry, dinner, lunch, breakfast, coffee, pizza
music, song, favourite song, favorite song, my dog, my cat, nice view, pretty view, the view
up this late, fell asleep, just had, at work

~ intent question
what do you think, what's your favourite, what's your favorite, what is your favourite
what is your favorite, have you ever, do you like, do you ever, ever been, ever tried
what about you, how about you, are you sure, you ever, why do you, where are you from
how old, what's your story, tell me about, ever killed, what's that, what is that, who are you
do you dream

~ intent compliment
nice heal, great heal, good heal, nice heals, great heals, good heals
nice job, good job, great job, well done, nicely done, nice work, good work, nice one
you rock, you're awesome, you are awesome, awesome, amazing, you're great, you are great
good pull, great pull, nice pull, love you, you're a legend, you are a legend, legend, good game
well played, look great, looks great, looking good, love your, best

~ intent agree
yeah, yep, yup, yes, true, agreed, agree, fair enough, exactly, indeed, sounds good, sure
same, same here, me too, for sure, good point, makes sense, you're right, you are right
totally, absolutely, of course, ok, okay, right on, so true, deal, no problem, no worries

~ intent disagree
no, nope, nah, nay, disagree, not true, that's not true, don't think so, no way, wrong

~ intent sorry
sorry, my bad, oops, whoops, apologies, my fault

~ intent away
brb, afk, bio, bio break, be right back, one sec

~ intent back
i'm back, back now, back again, ok back

~ intent activity
what are you doing, what are you up to, what you up to, everyone up to
where are you headed, where you headed, where are you going, what you doing

~ intent howgoing
how are you, how are you doing, how you doing, how's it going, how is it going, how goes
how's things, how are things, how's your day, how is your day, you ok, you alright

~ intent mood
are you mad, you mad, are you angry, you angry, you upset, are you upset, grumpy, in a mood
bad mood

~ intent flirt
you're cute, you are cute, marry me, you're hot, you are hot, date me, kiss me, be mine
you're pretty, you are pretty

~ intent outofworldchat
football, basketball, baseball, hockey, soccer, game last night, netflix, movie, tv show
television

~ intent quote
i'll be back, call me snake, may the force be with you, here's johnny, i see dead people
you're gonna need a bigger boat, life moves pretty fast, bueller, inconceivable, as you wish
wax on, wax off, there can be only one, hasta la vista, get to the choppa, game over man
great scott, nobody puts baby in, be excellent to each other, party on, i have the power
say hello to my little friend, i am your father, these aren't the droids, by your command
you shall not pass

~ intent command
follow me, wait here, stay here, come here, stop, hold up, leave the group, leave group
make space, make room, go pull, you pull, start pulling, sit there, stay put

~ intent combatcall
heal me, heals please, need heals, need a heal, adds, incoming, run, train
